rooms_desc ({"This is the entrance hall of Fizgogs house.It is tastfully furnished with wood pannels on the walls and a marble floor with a design that leads your eys into it.there is a small table and some flowers growing here","This is obviousle the main room it has slate blue wall with the woodwork in a slightly darker shade producing a pleasant rusic atmospherethere is a large bay window with a beutifull view and a comfortable couch place in it so you can sit and look at the view.There is a pale gray couch and pair of armchairs set around the room facingthe wide screen Tv and video. There is also a stereo system tucked away in a corner","This is the bedroom.  There is a bed in the middle of this room a wardrobe on the east wall and a bedside table on both sides of the bed.  There is an alarm clock on one of the tables.  There is a dressing table under the window to the north.  The dresser has a small radio on th top in front of the mirror.  ","This is a continuation of the hall the wood pannelingand marble theme is continued here there is a chair and a small table here.","This is a large and airy kitchen with a built in oven a halogen hob down one side with a preparation area next to it.There is a table in the center.","This is a formal dining room.  There is a pale oak table big enough to seat six comfortably.  The table is surrounded by six yew chairs. There is a sideboard down one wall and a drinks cabinet on the other.There is a painting ocupying the wall opposite.The floor is pollished wood and the walls are painted to provide a feelingof space and comfort.","This is a study with wood panneling and bookshelve on the wallsthere is a capet on the floor and a table under the window to the south.  There are two comfy chairs in here near to the small stereo system...","This is a little path wandering down to the beach there are some shadytrees here and the whole feel of the place is idyllic.There is a door to a lovely house to the south and the path continues to the east.","This is a beutifull beach in Australia with a gentle blue ocean to the north and soft pale sand underfoot.  The sand is dotted with beutiful sea shells There is a lovely house to the south and there are some trees giving shade to the west...",0,})
